    "PDF CJK/emoji regression reproduced NUL glyphs in extracted real PDF text. Bundled TTF cmap coverage now emits explicit [U+XXXX] and a fallback notice. CSV/XLSX retain original Unicode and no font binaries/licenses/dependencies changed.",
