    "Current supported receipt/HEIC flow is retained; whole Wallet browser parents exercise image/PDF receipt handling. No real providers or notifications are called.",
    "No automatic migration/activation or production Wallet package-cap change. Settings storage16/standalone17 is explicit; existing SQL1–15 unchanged.",
    "W17/W18, legacy Asset binding/unified net worth, signed goal withdrawals, canonical bridge/protected recovery/cutover, remaining Productivity/M1/I02/I03 and whole-plan acceptance remain.",
